forming initially.

00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:38.358
The leader of that resistance
was Kathleen's brother, Brian.

00:02:38.725 --> 00:02:42.662
The way that Kathleen talks about him,
he was more of a positive vibes, pacifist

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:43.963
kind of resistance leader.

00:02:43.963 --> 00:02:45.131
But everyone loved him.

00:02:45.131 --> 00:02:48.067
He was super charismatic,
according to members of their group.

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:52.238
In present day, like Perry, for instance,
her brother never actually did anything

00:02:52.372 --> 00:02:55.441
like never ultimately accomplished
any of the real goals that their group

00:02:55.441 --> 00:02:59.045
had or effected any real change
