and they didn't like little kids.

00:07:28.681 --> 00:07:32.018
Like they were just more hungry mouths
to feed and they had limited resources.

00:07:32.285 --> 00:07:33.519
We find out that the doctor

00:07:33.519 --> 00:07:37.590
Kathleen, just executed in episode
four, took pity on them and gave them his

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:41.260
shelter, which he himself got from another
Fed regard that owed him a favor.

00:07:41.594 --> 00:07:45.198
Their storyline then catches up
with John Ellie's storyline in present day

00:07:45.198 --> 00:07:46.766
when the doctor doesn't return.

00:07:46.766 --> 00:07:49.669
That was also meant to be the day
Kathleen captured and shot him.

00:07:49.702 --> 00:07:51.103
That's why he didn't come back.

00:07:51.103 --> 00:07:54.273
And they're forced to seek shelter
in the same office building where they met

00:07:54.273 --> 00:07:55.141
Joe and Ellie.

00:07:55.141 --> 00:07:58.611
But the idea was, is
that Henry was trying to follow them,

00:07:58.611 --> 00:08:00.480
and that's why
they came to the same office building,

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:03.783
because he was looking for Joel, thinking
that they could help each other escape.

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:06.853
It wasn't like they accidentally
ran into Joe and Ellie.

00:08:07.186 --> 00:08:09.355
There were a lot of moments here
that were from the game,

00:08:09.355 --> 00:08:10.923
but from different parts of the game.

00:08:10.923 --> 00:08:13.159
So there's some subtle changes
in the way they meet up

00:08:13.159 --> 00:08:15.661
and then meeting up in the office
building just in general.

00:08:15.928 --> 00:08:18.030
In the game,
it was just a normal apartment building

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:21.000
and it was during the daytime
and they have a knockdown, drag out fight.

00:08:21.067 --> 00:08:22.635
But just like on the show,

00:08:22.635 --> 00:08:26.072
Sam is the one that has the gun on Joe
getting them to stop fighting.

00:08:26.839 --> 00:08:30.510
Yeah, I thought you were one of them, too.

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:31.277
And I saw you.

00:08:32.778 --> 00:08:33.179
If you haven't

00:08:33.179 --> 00:08:36.182
noticed, they don't keep kids around.

00:08:36.182 --> 00:08:38.251
Survival of the fittest.

00:08:38.251 --> 00:08:41.687
There was also a sound based trap
like Jaws that went up outside the door.

00:08:41.687 --> 00:08:44.757
But in the game they found that later
