00:08:45.091 --> 00:08:48.394
One of the other parallels
between Kathleen and Joel briefly here,

00:08:48.427 --> 00:08:50.263
like they're going to be dark
mirrors of each other.

00:08:50.263 --> 00:08:52.131
Joel meant to be the more positive
end of that.

00:08:52.131 --> 00:08:53.966
Kathleen The more negative end of that.

00:08:53.966 --> 00:08:58.170
But in both cases, they equally hate
collaborators like Joel doesn't want

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:01.073
have anything to do with Henry when
he finds out that he was a collaborator

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:04.143
until later in his character arc,
he starts opening up to him

00:09:04.143 --> 00:09:07.613
and he starts to understand
why he did what he did and forgive him.

00:09:07.813 --> 00:09:09.482
Whereas Kathleen, not so much.

00:09:09.482 --> 00:09:11.083
No forgiveness happening there,

00:09:11.083 --> 00:09:11.984
but that's one of the reasons

00:09:11.984 --> 00:09:13.319
why Kathleen is meant to be one of

00:09:13.319 --> 00:09:17.123
the most tragic characters in the show,
because all the characters in general

00:09:17.123 --> 00:09:18.190
are tragic characters.

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:20.493
It is the Kathleen happens
to be the most tragic

00:09:20.493 --> 00:09:21.227
because she doesn't

00:09:21.227 --> 00:09:25.031
learn anything from her experiences and
it winds up leading to her eventual death.

00:09:25.264 --> 00:09:26.632
You probably still be alive.

00:09:26.632 --> 00:09:28.801
If you hadn't spent all that time
chasing Henry down,

00:09:28.801 --> 00:09:31.137
wouldn't let all those infected escape
either.

00:09:31.304 --> 00:09:32.538
You start to notice Perry too.

00:09:32.538 --> 00:09:34.540
He even seems like
he wants to take pity on Henry.

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:36.909
And Sam's like, Do we need to worry
about these two little kids?

00:09:36.909 --> 00:09:38.611
Like,
come on, this is way more important stuff.

00:09:38.611 --> 00:09:39.812
We should be worried about.

00:09:39.812 --> 00:09:43.449
When Henry and Sam meet the doctor for the
first time in his hiding spot, his line.

00:09:43.449 --> 00:09:45.318
Why go through the trouble?
You can kill yourself.

00:09:45.318 --> 00:09:47.253
Right here is meant to be dark.

00:09:47.253 --> 00:09:49.322
Foreshadowing for their deaths,
because eventually he does

00:09:49.322 --> 00:09:52.158
