00:10:14.113 --> 00:10:16.082
He reluctantly agrees to help them

00:10:16.082 --> 00:10:19.151
until eventually
they warm up to each other in the game.

00:10:19.151 --> 00:10:21.520
It was the Pittsburgh Bridge
