00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:22.922
Like that was their big point of escape.

00:10:22.922 --> 00:10:25.391
On the show, there was a bridge
that they did reference,

00:10:25.391 --> 00:10:27.960
but it wasn't as big
a part of the episode.

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:29.362
Ellie's relationship with Henry

00:10:29.362 --> 00:10:31.831
and Sam is relatively similar
